          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every piece is made by hand in our ateliers around Milan, by artisans we chose ourselves after visiting their workshops and seeing their work firsthand. Edges are hand-stitched and hand-burnished, a finishing step that keeps leather from fraying at the seams over years of use. Pieces are made in small batches, to order - never mass-produced. Read more about the people and the ateliers behind the work on our <a href=\"https://www.oberndoerferco.com/pages/about-us\" title=\"About Oberndörfer Milano\">About</a> page.</p>",
